; The follower mark is a font tile, and 1bpp font tiles only ever use color 0 for the paper and
; color 3 for the ink -- which is black in every palette the party menu otherwise loads. This one
; exists so the star can be red.
; Mute it by lowering the red channel, not by raising green and blue: the overworld's own red
; (30,10,06) reads as salmon here, because those two channels wash the hue out.
	RGB 31, 31, 31
	RGB 31, 31, 31
	RGB 22, 00, 00
	RGB 22, 00, 00
